      "message": "BIP-352: add test vectors for malleated p2pkh pubkey extraction\n\nAdd two p2pkh inputs whose scriptSig also pushes another valid pubkey.\n\nIn `<sig> <pubkey> <bogus_sig> OP_OVER OP_CHECKSIG OP_IF <other_pubkey>\nOP_ENDIF`, evaluating the scriptSig with a checker that accepts any\nsignature leaves <other_pubkey> on top of the stack. This is the\nscriptSig of the test added in bitcoin/bitcoin#36338.\n\nIn `<other_pubkey> OP_DROP <sig> <pubkey>`, taking the first 33-byte\npush without checking its hash finds <other_pubkey>.",
